{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30854","headline":"府试观开元皇帝东封图 · 马戴","name":"府试观开元皇帝东封图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俨若翠华举，登封图乍开。\n冕旒明主立，冠剑侍臣陪。\n迹类飞仙去，光同拜日来。\n粉痕疑检玉，黛色讶生苔。\n挂壁云将起，陵风仗若回。\n何年复东幸，鲁叟望悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}